WEBVTT

00:00:15.335 --> 00:00:17.511
[excited chatter]

00:00:52.198 --> 00:00:55.244
[sirens wailing][indistinct radio chatter]

00:01:15.090 --> 00:01:17.266
[siren wails]

00:01:23.272 --> 00:01:25.013
It'll be okay, Sonic.

00:01:25.187 --> 00:01:26.841
It'll be okay?

00:01:27.015 --> 00:01:29.539
Tom is fighting for his life
and you think it'll be okay?

00:01:29.713 --> 00:01:32.934
The fox is simply trying
to comfort you.

00:01:33.108 --> 00:01:34.979
Comfort's not
what I need right now.

00:01:35.154 --> 00:01:38.287
I need to stop them.
By any means necessary.

00:01:38.461 --> 00:01:39.636
Wait, you don't mean--

00:01:39.810 --> 00:01:41.899
The Master Emerald.

00:01:42.073 --> 00:01:45.251
The Emerald must never be
wielded for vengeance.

00:01:45.425 --> 00:01:46.469
Not ever!

00:01:46.643 --> 00:01:48.297
We swore a sacred oath.

00:01:48.471 --> 00:01:50.430
Don't talk to me about oaths.
Not now!

00:01:50.604 --> 00:01:52.475
But you told Tom
using the Emerald

00:01:52.649 --> 00:01:54.085
wasn't the right choice.

00:01:54.260 --> 00:01:56.349
Well, now it's the only choice.

00:01:56.523 --> 00:01:58.307
And if neither of you
have the guts to help me,

00:01:58.481 --> 00:01:59.917
then I'll do it alone.

00:02:00.091 --> 00:02:02.181
But I thought
the three of us
were a team.

00:02:02.355 --> 00:02:04.357
I thought that's what
made us special.

00:02:04.531 --> 00:02:06.315
I'm not asking you twice,
Knuckles.

00:02:07.186 --> 00:02:10.014
Where is the Master Emerald?

00:02:11.755 --> 00:02:15.106
Your heart is being consumed
by anger, hedgehog.

00:02:15.281 --> 00:02:18.327
You are in no condition
to make decisions right now.

00:02:18.501 --> 00:02:21.069
I know you're upset about Tom.
We all are.

00:02:21.243 --> 00:02:22.940
Last chance.

00:02:23.114 --> 00:02:25.726
Where... is it?

00:02:26.292 --> 00:02:27.815
Don't do this.

00:02:34.474 --> 00:02:37.433
Part of our oath
is to trust each other.

00:02:37.607 --> 00:02:39.827
And I must abide
by that promise,

00:02:40.001 --> 00:02:42.308
even if you have chosen
to break it.

00:02:42.482 --> 00:02:44.223
But heed this warning:

00:02:44.397 --> 00:02:47.748
The Master Emerald is guarded
by a fearsome warrior.

00:02:47.922 --> 00:02:50.098
And to seize
this ultimate power,

00:02:50.272 --> 00:02:52.187
you will have to go...

00:02:52.361 --> 00:02:54.407
through him.

00:02:54.581 --> 00:02:55.712
[exhales deeply]

00:02:55.886 --> 00:02:58.498
Okay, Wade...
all comes down to this.

00:02:59.238 --> 00:03:00.891
Last few seconds.

00:03:01.065 --> 00:03:02.197
Whipple down the ice.

00:03:02.371 --> 00:03:05.896
He shoots... he scores!

00:03:06.070 --> 00:03:09.117
Wade Whipple
is a champion again!

00:03:09.291 --> 00:03:10.466
[cackles]

00:03:15.036 --> 00:03:18.213
Oh, hey, Sonic. See my goal?
Pretty sick, right?

00:03:18.387 --> 00:03:20.215
I'm here for the Emerald.

00:03:20.389 --> 00:03:21.912
Look, Sonic, I'm sorry.

00:03:22.086 --> 00:03:24.263
I promised to guard this emerald
with my life.

00:03:24.437 --> 00:03:26.265
I will do whatever it takes--

00:03:27.396 --> 00:03:28.484
Well, I tried.

00:03:30.399 --> 00:03:32.619
[thunder rumbling]

00:03:33.924 --> 00:03:34.925
[Wade] Sonic!

00:03:38.842 --> 00:03:39.843
Too bright!

00:03:43.456 --> 00:03:46.502
[woman] <i>This is an urgent
national emergency broadcast.</i>

00:03:46.676 --> 00:03:49.113
<i>A spacecraft designed
by the agency GUN</i>

00:03:49.288 --> 00:03:52.203
<i>has been hijacked and launched
out of the River Thames.</i>

00:03:52.378 --> 00:03:55.990
[man broadcasting in Japanese]

00:03:57.992 --> 00:04:01.038
[man] <i>All residents are urged
to seek immediate shelter.</i>

00:04:23.104 --> 00:04:25.367
[Gerald] It's time, Shadow.

00:04:27.021 --> 00:04:31.112
Professor, is this really
what Maria would have wanted?

00:04:33.897 --> 00:04:37.248
The question isn't
what Maria would have wanted.

00:04:38.380 --> 00:04:40.382
It's what do they deserve.

00:04:41.383 --> 00:04:43.864
Remember what she meant to us.

00:04:45.735 --> 00:04:48.651
Remember what they took from us.

00:04:59.096 --> 00:05:00.141
[Gerald] Kids!

00:05:00.315 --> 00:05:02.230
We have to go, now!

00:05:02.404 --> 00:05:04.014
[Maria panting]

00:05:07.453 --> 00:05:09.890
[Gerald] They want to take
Shadow away from us, Maria!

00:05:14.721 --> 00:05:15.896
[weapons charging]

00:05:18.507 --> 00:05:21.205
Hey! Hey! What are you doing?
Those are children.

00:05:21.380 --> 00:05:23.164
- We've got our orders, Walters!
- Stand down!

00:05:24.818 --> 00:05:26.689
[gasps]

00:05:34.567 --> 00:05:36.569
[muffled rumbling]

00:05:37.961 --> 00:05:39.180
[high-pitched whistling]

00:05:39.354 --> 00:05:41.095
[groaning]

00:05:47.014 --> 00:05:48.232
Huh?

00:05:49.799 --> 00:05:50.887
Maria!

